hadiths[5]{hadithnumber,text}:
"348","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id Khudri (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Ramadan ke darmiyani ashre mein e'tikaf farmate. Phir ek saal Aap ne e'tikaf farmaya yahan tak ke jab ikkeeswin ki raat aayi, jo woh raat thi jis ki subah Aap Apne e'tikaf se nikalte the, to Aap ne farmaya: 'Jo mere sath e'tikaf mein tha woh aakhri ashre mein e'tikaf kare.' Aur farmaya: 'Mujhe yeh raat dikhai gayi phir mujhe bhula di gayi.' Aur farmaya: 'Main ne khud ko dekha ke us ki subah pani aur mitti [keechad] mein sajda kar raha hun; to use aakhri ashre mein talash karo, aur use har taaq [raat] mein talash karo.' Abu Sa'id kehte hain: Phir us raat aasman se barish hui, aur masjid chhappar [khajoor ki shakhan] par thi, to masjid tapakne lagi. Abu Sa'id kehte hain: To meri dono aankhon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko dekha ke Aap hamari taraf [namaz se] phire, jabke Aap ki peshani aur naak par ikkeeswin ki subah pani aur mitti ka nishan tha."
"349","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha), Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki zauja se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab e'tikaf farmate to Apna sar meri taraf jhuka dete aur main use sanwarti; aur Aap ghar mein dakhil nahin hote siwae insani hajat [ke liye]."
"350","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) masjid mein e'tikaf farma the, to Aap ne Apna sar meri taraf nikala, to main ne use dhoya jabke main haiza thi."
"351","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah [Raziyallahu anha] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) masjid se Apna sar meri taraf jhukate jabke Aap e'tikaf mein hote aur main haiza hoti, to main use dhoti."
"352","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id Khudri (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Ramadan mein mahine ke darmiyani ashre mein [e'tikaf] thaharte. Phir jab bees raaten guzar jane ke ba'd shaam hoti aur ikkeeswin ka istiqbal hota to Aap Apne rehne ki jagah wapas jate, aur jo Aap ke sath [e'tikaf] thhaharte woh bhi wapas jate. Phir Aap ek mahine mein khade rahe jis mein Aap ne [e'tikaf] thhahra, us raat mein jis mein Aap wapas jaya karte the. Phir Aap ne logon ko khutba diya aur unhen us ka hukm diya jo Allah Azz wa Jall ne chaha, phir farmaya: 'Beshak main is ashre mein [e'tikaf] thhaharta tha, phir mujhe yeh zahir hua ke main is aakhri ashre mein [e'tikaf] thhahrun; to jo mere sath e'tikaf mein tha woh Apne e'tikaf ki jagah mein thhahra rahe. Aur mujhe yeh raat dikhai gayi phir mujhe bhula di gayi; to use aakhri ashre mein talash karo aur use har taaq mein talash karo. Aur main ne khud ko dekha ke us ki subah mitti aur pani mein sajda kar raha hun.' Abu Sa'id kehte hain: Phir us raat aasman par badal chhae aur barish hui, to ikkeeswin ki raat Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki namaz ki jagah par masjid tapki. Meri aankh ne dekha: Main ne Aap ko dekha ke Aap Subah ki namaz se phire, jabke Aap ki peshani mitti aur pani se bhari thi."
